1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,402
Startup ASEAN makes thousands
of connections every year!

2
00:00:03,402 --> 00:00:05,880
But almost none get tracked into real deals.

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,793
Connections die after the handshake.

4
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:09,193
Meet Nexus Net!

5
00:00:09,193 --> 00:00:12,400
A game where every connection
has to become a real outcome.

6
00:00:12,662 --> 00:00:15,296
Register your company and upload your documents.

7
00:00:15,296 --> 00:00:20,677
Gemma 4 checks them and issues a verified passport,
so every outcome is tied to a real company.

8
00:00:20,948 --> 00:00:24,582
Pick your startup and see your level,
from Connected all the way to Funded.

9
00:00:24,582 --> 00:00:26,995
Now growth has a ladder you can actually climb!

10
00:00:27,266 --> 00:00:33,846
Six quick taps on your needs, and Gemma turns the gaps into quests
with the right talent, so nobody gets stuck after the intro.

11
00:00:34,112 --> 00:00:39,312
Gemma 4 writes five cross-border quests, so
every intro turns into a concrete next step.

12
00:00:39,566 --> 00:00:42,429
Upload the proof, Gemma verifies it, and boom!

13
00:00:42,429 --> 00:00:44,146
XP jumps and you level up.

14
00:00:44,146 --> 00:00:46,037
That's a real, measurable outcome.

15
00:00:46,292 --> 00:00:51,296
Subscribe to ecosystem events and earn
bonus XP, so showing up actually counts.

16
00:00:51,554 --> 00:00:56,960
Switch to Talent, and freelancers see gigs straight
from startup quests, so startups get help fast.

17
00:00:57,224 --> 00:01:02,021
Switch to Investor, and backers see
verified traction, not pitch-deck promises.

18
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:04,567
Startups battle for the top of the leaderboard.

19
00:01:04,567 --> 00:01:05,263
Let's go!

20
00:01:05,516 --> 00:01:10,411
The live ASEAN map draws every cross-border
win, so you can see where deals really happen.

21
00:01:10,658 --> 00:01:16,292
And Cradle finally sees the whole funnel, from
connection to investment, by country and by event.

22
00:01:16,544 --> 00:01:19,439
Nexus Net, every quest is a measurable outcome.

23
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,700
Built with Gemma 4!
